{"version":1,"key":"card:708","content":{"id":708,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9a2ec2f8-5422-4795-8db6-fccdf4c4b8a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"企业在发行新股（IPO 或增发）时，通常不具备独立完成销售的能力：不懂如何定价、没有面向投资者的销售渠道、也缺乏证券发行的专业经验。因此需要聘请投资银行或证券公司，由其将股票销售给广大投资者，这个过程就是股票承销。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c955c309-3dfc-4365-a68b-1acad24ac4b7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"承销根据风险承担方式的不同，分为三种："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"e1542b38-d8f5-468f-b692-56431bb6dd1e","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"cf61f5af-eed6-4ee3-a009-619cb8517086","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"358df9b0-8b9b-443a-b5b5-770a912e9e24","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"包销：承销商以约定价格将股票全部买下，再加价卖给投资者，赚取买入价与发行价之间的价差。承销商承担全部销售风险。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f2b1329e-402b-4086-a24d-ba19255d3a1d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ba53a17f-b1d0-49b7-8346-befaabcd3fad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"代销：承销商不承诺全部卖出，而是尽最大能力利用自身销售网络帮助企业卖出股票。到了约定期限仍未售出的部分退还给企业，承销商仅收取佣金作为报酬。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f60a1de8-add4-483f-a64c-9c9961f20bd6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"609eebc5-5297-4f65-ab6f-46cf8d498b08","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"余额包销：介于包销与代销之间。承销商先尽可能将股票卖给投资者，到约定日期仍未售出的部分，由承销商全部买入。"}]}]}]}],"tags":["金融/股票承销","概念"],"createTime":1778807466968,"updateTime":1778807964338,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1778807964338}}